      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1751932800000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE FAILURE\n\nMid-rebalance, a secondary\nflips itself to primary. Old\nprimary demotes. ~20% of the\ndata is gone.\n\n“Losing 20% is worse than\nlosing all of it — you don’t\nknow what you lost.”",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "THE FAILURE\n\nMid-rebalance, a secondary\nflips itself to primary. Old\nprimary demotes. ~20% of the\ndata is gone.\n\n“Losing 20% is worse than\nlosing all of it — you don’t\nknow what you lost.”",
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
